  - packages/cli/src/workspace-ui.test.ts
files_modified:
  - packages/cli/src/lib/compose-video-project.ts
  - packages/cli/src/lib/media-project.ts
  - packages/cli/src/commands/studio.ts
  - packages/cli/src/web/workspace-app.ts
learnings:
  - Per-file transcripts (transcripts/<basename>.json) is the right multi-media convention. The legacy root transcript.json stays for back-compat with the single-source VideoProject flow but doesn't scale beyond one media file. transcribeMediaFile wraps transcribeProject so both contracts coexist.
  - Live WS subscription for sidebar refresh closes the UX gap where ingest succeeded but the UI didn't show it — the bundle's broadcast envelopes were already there, the subscriber wiring was the missing half.
